; The months of #budgets. A budget's months run from the month of its definition through the latest of its own last
; directive, the ledger's last month with a transaction and the current month (by the clock, in the ledger's
; timezone): a budget-add planned ahead extends them, a price, event, note or balance far ahead does not. A month
; after a budget's last one reads as that month carried over, nothing spent.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "America/New_York"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD

2023-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2023-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Food

2023-06-01 budget Food CNY
2023-06-01 budget-add Food 100 CNY

2023-08-10 * "Market" "the last transaction of the ledger"
  Expenses:Food 10 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2023-09-01 budget Plan CNY
2024-12-01 budget-add Plan 50 CNY

2023-10-01 budget Short CNY
2023-11-15 budget-close Short

; far ahead, but none of these extends the months
2030-01-01 price USD 7 CNY
2031-01-01 event "location" "Mars"
2032-01-01 note Assets:Bank "a note"
2033-01-01 balance Assets:Bank -10 CNY
